{
  "id": "6a78b3f729c4ec3791a74707",
  "title": "ウェブブラウザの実装ミス：:is() に子結合子を指定することができないバグ、CSS Nesting に関する :is() と :has() のバグ",
  "created": 1786295288,
  "updated": 1788328557,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6a78b3f729c4ec3791a74707",
      "text": "ウェブブラウザの実装ミス：:is() に子結合子を指定することができないバグ、CSS Nesting に関する :is() と :has() のバグ",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786295288,
      "updated": 1787978511
    },
    {
      "id": "6a92637f00000000003223b0",
      "text": "あとで書き直します[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787978624,
      "updated": 1787978634
    },
    {
      "id": "6a97b99f0000000000eb733b",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788328366,
      "updated": 1788328366
    },
    {
      "id": "6a97b99f0000000000eb733c",
      "text": "あとでよむ",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788328366,
      "updated": 1788328459
    },
    {
      "id": "6a97b9b60000000000eb733d",
      "text": "　[https://www.w3.org/TR/selectors-4/ Selectors Level 4 W3C Working Draft, 22 January 2026 (w3.org)]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788328374,
      "updated": 1788328427
    },
    {
      "id": "6a92637f00000000003223b1",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787978624,
      "updated": 1787978624
    },
    {
      "id": "6a78b3f70000000000528c8b",
      "text": "from [2026/08/06]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1786295288,
      "updated": 1786295288
    },
    {
      "id": "6a78b3f70000000000528c8d",
      "text": "[Nrem.icon]ウェブブラウザの実装ミスで :has() 内に子結合子入りの :is() を指定不能なバグを直してほしい",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786295288,
      "updated": 1788328480
    },
    {
      "id": "6a78b3f70000000000528c8e",
      "text": "　:has() ってブラウザに実装されてからもう何年目でしたっけ",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786295288,
      "updated": 1787978426
    },
    {
      "id": "6a78b3f70000000000528c8f",
      "text": "　ちなみに、[:has()] 内の [:is()] 内の子孫結合子は機能します。死んでしまっているのは[子結合子]です",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786295288,
      "updated": 1788327364
    },
    {
      "id": "6a78b3f70000000000528c92",
      "text": "　以下はCSSの仕様上有効なスタイル指定のはずだが、ChromiumやFirefoxではなぜか無効になります",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786295288,
      "updated": 1788326670
    },
    {
      "id": "6a78b3f70000000000528c94",
      "text": "　　code:css",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786295288,
      "updated": 1788327389
    },
    {
      "id": "6a78b3f70000000000528c95",
      "text": "   .text:not(.cursor-line > *):has(> :is(",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1786295288,
      "updated": 1786295288
    },
    {
      "id": "6a78b3f70000000000528c96",
      "text": "   \tspan > span,",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1786295288,
      "updated": 1786295288
    },
    {
      "id": "6a78b3f70000000000528c97",
      "text": "   \tspan > span > span",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1786295288,
      "updated": 1786295288
    },
    {
      "id": "6a78b3f70000000000528c98",
      "text": "   ) > a:not(.page-link) > :is(img.image, img.strong-image)) {",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1786295288,
      "updated": 1786295288
    },
    {
      "id": "6a78b3f70000000000528c99",
      "text": "   \ttext-align: center;",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1786295288,
      "updated": 1786295288
    },
    {
      "id": "6a78b3f70000000000528c9a",
      "text": "   }",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1786295288,
      "updated": 1786295288
    },
    {
      "id": "6a97b8e10000000000d63e29",
      "text": "　`:has(* :is(*) > *)` は動く",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788328162,
      "updated": 1788328168
    },
    {
      "id": "6a97b8e10000000000d63e2a",
      "text": "　`:has(> :is(*) *)` や `:has(:is(> *) *)` は動かない",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788328162,
      "updated": 1788328168
    },
    {
      "id": "6a97b4ea0000000000d63e0b",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788327147,
      "updated": 1788327167
    },
    {
      "id": "6a78b3f70000000000528c9b",
      "text": " Chromium/Firefox で次のように指定すると（なぜか）動く",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786295288,
      "updated": 1788327396
    },
    {
      "id": "6a97b64b0000000000d63e14",
      "text": "　　これは動いちゃだめなやつ。CSSの仕様の有効な解釈ではないと思う",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788327499,
      "updated": 1788327499
    },
    {
      "id": "6a78b3f70000000000528c9c",
      "text": " 　　code:A.css",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786295288,
      "updated": 1788327634
    },
    {
      "id": "6a78b3f70000000000528c9d",
      "text": "    .text:not(.cursor-line > *) { &:has(:is(",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786295288,
      "updated": 1788327634
    },
    {
      "id": "6a78b3f70000000000528c9e",
      "text": "    \t& > span > span,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786295288,
      "updated": 1788327634
    },
    {
      "id": "6a78b3f70000000000528c9f",
      "text": "    \t& > span > span > span",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786295288,
      "updated": 1788327634
    },
    {
      "id": "6a78b3f70000000000528ca0",
      "text": "    ) > a:not(.page-link) > :is(img.image, img.strong-image)) {",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786295288,
      "updated": 1788327634
    },
    {
      "id": "6a78b3f70000000000528ca1",
      "text": "    \ttext-align: center;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786295288,
      "updated": 1788327634
    },
    {
      "id": "6a78b3f70000000000528ca2",
      "text": "    } }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786295288,
      "updated": 1788327634
    },
    {
      "id": "6a97b21f0000000000d63e02",
      "text": "　　:is() 内の & の展開に関してバグを疑う。上記（A.css）の次の箇所は本来、",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788326432,
      "updated": 1788327671
    },
    {
      "id": "6a97b17b0000000000d63df5",
      "text": " 　　code:B.css",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788326268,
      "updated": 1788327619
    },
    {
      "id": "6a97b1840000000000d63df6",
      "text": " 　　 .text:not(.cursor-line > *) { &:has(:is(",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788326276,
      "updated": 1788327326
    },
    {
      "id": "6a97b1850000000000d63df7",
      "text": "       \t& > span > span,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788326277,
      "updated": 1788327326
    },
    {
      "id": "6a97b1850000000000d63df8",
      "text": "       \t& > span > span > span",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788326277,
      "updated": 1788327326
    },
    {
      "id": "6a97b1850000000000d63df9",
      "text": "      )",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788326277,
      "updated": 1788327326
    },
    {
      "id": "6a97b1f70000000000d63e01",
      "text": "  次のように指定した場合（C.css）と全く同じ結果が得られることが期待されるはずだが、そうはなっていない",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788326392,
      "updated": 1788327690
    },
    {
      "id": "6a97b1a80000000000d63dfc",
      "text": "   code:C.css",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788326313,
      "updated": 1788327613
    },
    {
      "id": "6a97b1b30000000000d63dfd",
      "text": "    .text:not(.cursor-line > *):has(",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788326323,
      "updated": 1788327315
    },
    {
      "id": "6a97b2610000000000d63e03",
      "text": "     \t.text:not(.cursor-line > *) > span > span,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788326498,
      "updated": 1788327315
    },
    {
      "id": "6a97b1b50000000000d63dff",
      "text": "     \t.text:not(.cursor-line > *) > span > span > span",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788326326,
      "updated": 1788327315
    },
    {
      "id": "6a97b1b50000000000d63e00",
      "text": "     )",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788326326,
      "updated": 1788327315
    },
    {
      "id": "6a97b70b0000000000d63e15",
      "text": "  その代わりに次の D.css と等価のように扱われてしまう",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788327692,
      "updated": 1788328522
    },
    {
      "id": "6a97b7570000000000d63e16",
      "text": " 　　code:D.css",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788327768,
      "updated": 1788327922
    },
    {
      "id": "6a97b7570000000000d63e17",
      "text": "    .text:not(.cursor-line > *):is(",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788327768,
      "updated": 1788327949
    },
    {
      "id": "6a97b80c0000000000d63e21",
      "text": "      :has(> span > span),",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788327949,
      "updated": 1788327962
    },
    {
      "id": "6a97b7570000000000d63e19",
      "text": "    \t:has(> span > span > span)",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788327768,
      "updated": 1788327966
    },
    {
      "id": "6a97b7570000000000d63e1a",
      "text": "    )",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788327768,
      "updated": 1788328557
    },
    {
      "id": "6a97b77a0000000000d63e1d",
      "text": "  　ちなみに :has() 内に子結合子と組み合わせた :is() を含めることはできないが、:is() 内に :has() を含めることはできるらしい",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788327803,
      "updated": 1788328536
    },
    {
      "id": "6a78b3f70000000000528ca4",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1786295288,
      "updated": 1786295288
    },
    {
      "id": "6a92629700000000003223ae",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787978392,
      "updated": 1787978392
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9262910000000000322395",
      "text": "from [2026/08/12]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787978386,
      "updated": 1787978386
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9262910000000000322396",
      "text": "[Nrem.icon][出典記法]の表示が壊れている",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787978386,
      "updated": 1787978445
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9262910000000000322397",
      "text": "　UserCSS単独だと意図通りに表示されることを確認しました。井戸端の Settings の方に原因があるらしい",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787978386,
      "updated": 1787978386
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9262910000000000322398",
      "text": "　[scrapbox-bundler] が :is() や :where() 内の & を削除する挙動が原因のようです",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787978386,
      "updated": 1787978386
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9262910000000000322399",
      "text": "   [リンクを出典アイコンにするUserCSS：実装ページ#6a6cb369000000000018e590]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787978386,
      "updated": 1787978386
    },
    {
      "id": "6a926291000000000032239a",
      "text": "   [リンクを出典アイコンにするUserCSS：実装ページ#6a6cb2a5000000000018e589]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787978386,
      "updated": 1787978386
    },
    {
      "id": "6a926291000000000032239b",
      "text": "   bundle後→[Settings#6a7c307300000000003c5f21]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787978386,
      "updated": 1787978386
    },
    {
      "id": "6a926291000000000032239c",
      "text": "　　以前正常に適用されていたのは、bundlerを通さずにUserCSSをSettingsに直接コピペしていたため",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787978386,
      "updated": 1787978386
    },
    {
      "id": "6a926291000000000032239d",
      "text": "　　困った。対策としては、",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787978386,
      "updated": 1787978386
    },
    {
      "id": "6a926291000000000032239e",
      "text": "　　　1. & 入りの :is() や :where() を使わない",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787978386,
      "updated": 1787978386
    },
    {
      "id": "6a926291000000000032239f",
      "text": "   \t1. 可：`:is(& > a, & > span:not(.char-index):first-of-type > a).link { ... }`",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787978386,
      "updated": 1787978386
    },
    {
      "id": "6a92629100000000003223a0",
      "text": "   \t　井戸端では bundle 後に 4. 不可 に置換されるため不可",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787978386,
      "updated": 1787978386
    },
    {
      "id": "6a92629100000000003223a1",
      "text": "   \t2. 可：`& > a.link, & > span:not(.char-index):first-of-type > a.link { ... }`",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787978386,
      "updated": 1787978386
    },
    {
      "id": "6a92629100000000003223a2",
      "text": "   \t3. 不可：`& > :is(a, span:not(.char-index):first-of-type > a).link { ... }`",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787978386,
      "updated": 1787978386
    },
    {
      "id": "6a92629100000000003223a3",
      "text": "   \t　それはそうと、なぜブラウザはこのスタイル指定を受け付けないのだろう",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787978386,
      "updated": 1787978386
    },
    {
      "id": "6a92629100000000003223a4",
      "text": "   \t4. 不可：`:is(> a, > span:not(.char-index):first-of-type > a).link { ... }`",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787978386,
      "updated": 1787978386
    },
    {
      "id": "6a92629100000000003223a5",
      "text": " 　　　　これもブラウザが受け付けない",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787978386,
      "updated": 1787978386
    },
    {
      "id": "6a92629100000000003223a6",
      "text": "　　　2. bundler の挙動が変更されるまでの間、直接 @import の対象にする",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787978386,
      "updated": 1787978386
    },
    {
      "id": "6a92629100000000003223a7",
      "text": "　　　　まあ @import が一つ増えるくらいなら読み込み時間に大して影響しないはず",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787978386,
      "updated": 1787978386
    },
    {
      "id": "6a92629100000000003223a8",
      "text": "　　まじか。報告ありがとうございます[takker.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787978386,
      "updated": 1787978386
    },
    {
      "id": "6a92629100000000003223a9",
      "text": "　　 esbuildのversion上げたら直るかな",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787978386,
      "updated": 1787978386
    },
    {
      "id": "6a92629100000000003223aa",
      "text": "　 正直ブラウザ側の[実装ミス]を疑います[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787978386,
      "updated": 1787978468
    },
    {
      "id": "6a92629100000000003223ab",
      "text": "　 　もしブラウザのバグなら、こちらが放置していてもいずれブラウザのアップデートで対応されるかもしれません",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787978386,
      "updated": 1787978386
    },
    {
      "id": "6a92629100000000003223ac",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787978386,
      "updated": 1787978386
    },
    {
      "id": "6a92629100000000003223ad",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787978386,
      "updated": 1787978386
    }
  ]
}